<title>SINGAPORE: Bangladesh tenders to buy kerosene for Apr 9-10.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh tenders to buy kerosene for Apr 9-10.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Bangladesh Petroleum Corp (BPC) has issued a tender to buy superior kerosene oil for April 9-10 deliveries, cost-and-freight Chittagong, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The tender, which seeks a 155,000-barrel cargo, closes on March 18 and offers will be valid until March 25.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
